    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "FE35EED32F281E40",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène de Mezclamora !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "FE35F1D32F282359",
      "text": "Comme pour tous les challengers, je vais devoir\\nd’abord noter votre nom.\\c\\nVous êtes [VAR 0x0100(0000)], n’est-ce pas ?\\nTrès bien, voilà qui est fait.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "FE35F0D32F2821A6",
      "text": "Afin de pouvoir affronter notre Champion,\\nOkuba, vous devrez tout d’abord réussir\\r\\nl’examen de l’Arène.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "FE35F3D32F2826BF",
      "text": "Vous vous demandez sûrement en quoi il consiste.\\nC’est simple, pour réussir l’examen, il suffit de...\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]commander le plat secret du menu[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "FE35F2D32F28250C",
      "text": "Vous devrez trouver de quel plat il s’agit grâce à\\ndes indices, et le commander au [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Trésor Culinaire[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\r\\nl’établissement phare de Mezclamora.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "FE35F5D32F282A25",
      "text": "À l’heure actuelle, il y a trois autres challengers\\nen train de passer l’examen dans la ville.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "FE35F4D32F282872",
      "text": "Ils détiennent tous un indice différent\\nau sujet de ce plat.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "FE35F7D32F282D8B",
      "text": "Vous devrez les affronter, et celui qui perd\\nle combat devra donner son indice au vainqueur.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "FE35F6D32F282BD8",
      "text": "Une fois que vous aurez réuni les indices,\\nvous pourrez commander le plat secret du menu\\r\\nauprès de l’équipe du Trésor Culinaire.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "FE3289D32F253CCA",
      "text": "Seule la personne qui aura réussi à passer\\nla bonne commande sera reçue à l’examen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "FE328AD32F253E7D",
      "text": "Voici votre indice : observez bien [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]comment les[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]habitués de l’établissement dégustent leur plat[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "FE3287D32F253964",
      "text": "Pour commencer, je vous conseille d’essayer\\nde leur parler !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
